<section class="dark" id="hood">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="kick">Under the hood</p>
    <h2>Three hooks. One engine. <em>Your</em> subagents.</h2>
    <p class="lede">Opus still plans. Horsy sits between the plan and the work, and only on the work your agent delegates.</p>
    <div class="hood" data-reveal>
      <svg class="wires" viewBox="0 0 1000 400" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true">
        <path d="M300 70 C 340 70 330 200 370 200"/><path class="flow" d="M300 70 C 340 70 330 200 370 200"/>
        <path d="M300 200 L 370 200"/><path class="flow" d="M300 200 L 370 200"/>
        <path d="M300 330 C 340 330 330 200 370 200"/><path class="flow" d="M300 330 C 340 330 330 200 370 200"/>
        <path d="M630 200 C 670 200 660 60 700 60"/><path class="flow" d="M630 200 C 670 200 660 60 700 60"/>
        <path d="M630 200 C 670 200 660 160 700 160"/><path class="flow" d="M630 200 C 670 200 660 160 700 160"/>
        <path d="M630 200 C 670 200 660 260 700 260"/><path class="flow" d="M630 200 C 670 200 660 260 700 260"/>
      </svg>
      <div class="hcol">
        <div class="hbox"><h4>SessionStart</h4><p>Loads Horsy’s rules into the session.</p></div>
        <div class="hbox"><h4>PreToolUse <code>· Agent</code></h4><p>Sees each subtask before it runs and picks the model.</p></div>
        <div class="hbox"><h4>Stop</h4><p>Asks for the check before the session closes. Retries are capped, and <code>/horsy off</code> always gets you out.</p></div>
      </div>
      <div class="engine">
        <h4><svg aria-hidden="true"><use href="#knight"/></svg>Horsy engine</h4>
        <ol><li><span>01</span>classify</li><li><span>02</span>pick rung</li><li><span>03</span>verify</li><li><span>04</span>receipt</li></ol>
      </div>
      <div class="hcol">
        <div class="hbox model"><h4>haiku</h4><i>rung 1</i></div>
        <div class="hbox model"><h4>sonnet</h4><i>rung 2</i></div>
        <div class="hbox model"><h4>opus</h4><i>rung 3</i></div>
        <div class="hbox model later"><h4>other providers</h4><i>later</i></div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="hnote">Your main session is never routed. Routing decisions run on your machine. In early access we are validating each hook on real sessions before launch.</p>
  </div>
</section>
